<li>Finower TTC (1995/96; 2. Bundesliga, Jerman )</li>
<li>Royal Villette Charleroi, ( Belgia ), sejak 1996)</li>
<li>TTC Weinheim (2.BL, Jerman)</li>
<li>TTF Ochsenhausen (Jerman)</li>
<li>Montpellier TT ( Prancis )</li>
<li>Hennebont (Prancis)</li>
</ul>
